async function syncManagementAvailability(){const d=vault();if(!admin||!d)return '';const own=ownWorkers()[0],records=[...(d.disponibilidadEmpleados||[]),...(own?(d.disponibilidad||[]).map(r=>({...r,empleado:own.employee_id})):[])],desired=[];for(const r of records){if(!workers.some(w=>w.active&&w.employee_id===r.empleado))continue;for(const slot of r.bloqueado?[{inicio:'00:00',fin:'00:00',next:true,motivo:r.motivo}]:(r.franjas||[])){const start=new Date(r.fecha+'T'+slot.inicio),end=new Date(r.fecha+'T'+slot.fin);if(slot.next)end.setDate(end.getDate()+1);if(!Number.isFinite(+start)||end<=start||end<=new Date())continue;desired.push({employee_id:r.empleado,starts_at:start.toISOString(),ends_at:end.toISOString(),reason:'[Gestión] '+(slot.motivo||r.motivo||'No disponible').slice(0,280)})}}const same=(a,b)=>a.employee_id===b.employee_id&&+new Date(a.starts_at)===+new Date(b.starts_at)&&+new Date(a.ends_at)===+new Date(b.ends_at);let changed=false;availabilitySyncWarning='';for(const b of blocks.filter(b=>b.reason?.startsWith('[Gestión] ')&&new Date(b.ends_at)>new Date()))if(!desired.some(x=>same(x,b))){await command('remove_availability',{id:b.id,employee_id:b.employee_id});changed=true}for(const p of desired){if(blocks.some(b=>same(b,p)))continue;if(services.some(s=>s.employee_id===p.employee_id&&['offered','assigned','in_progress','incident'].includes(s.status)&&new Date(s.starts_at)<new Date(p.ends_at)&&new Date(p.starts_at)<new Date(s.ends_at))){availabilitySyncWarning='Hay días bloqueados en Gestión que coinciden con servicios activos. Revisa su reasignación en Coordinación.';continue}await command('availability',p);changed=true}if(changed)blocks=await rows('coord_availability','&company_id=eq.'+encodeURIComponent(company)+'&order=starts_at.asc,id.asc');return availabilitySyncWarning||'Disponibilidad de Gestión compartida con Coordinación.'}
